  dialogue:
  - 'Welcome to Stick Nodes: Adventure!'
  - This is a test map, showcasing the many different things you, as the player,
    will be able to do.
  - 'You can press M1 to attack,

    M2 to use your chosen ability,

    Shift to
    dash, and F to block'
  - You can also counter attack by blocking attacks at the right time!
  - 'Go ahead and explore the game!

    There will be a lot more coming soon.'
  - Have fun!
